# Excludes files from the shinyapps.io deploy bundle (rsconnect::deployApp()).
# app.R only needs R/, config.R, and templates/ to run - everything below
# is local dev data/output/version control, not app code.
#
# NOTE: rsconnect matches these as EXACT top-level names (plain setdiff(),
# not gitignore-style globs) - no trailing slashes, no wildcards, no
# nested paths. See rsconnect:::ignoreBundleFiles.

data
output
FAIRe2OBIS
scripts
docs
CLAUDE.md
README.md
.RData
.claude
